Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix: web preview keyboard layout handling and
 profile-load race

- Key capture and the live test matched event.key against [a-z0-9], so they
  ignored every key under a non-Latin layout. Fall back to event.code.
- A layout import that arrived while a profile was still loading or saving
  raced with that operation; refuse it with the existing 'please wait' note.
- The browser tests imported a layout right after opening the editor without
  waiting for the profile load, and failed on slower machines (15/19 locally).
  Wait for the profile first.

Adds two browser regression tests.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
